  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aim of supporting Community Based Organisations (CBOs) to improve health promotion and prevention activities at village level, and to facilitate the linking and communication between people in the targeted villages and their public health facilities. Implementing partners are the Agency for Technical Co-operation and Development (ACTED), Aga Kahn Development Foundation and Mercy Corps.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
